menu "MaTouch 2.1in board"

config MATOUCH_LCD_SWAP_RB
    bool "Swap the red and blue channels"
    default y
    help
      The vendor firmware and the vendor wiki label the panel's red and blue
      data pins opposite ways round. The pin map follows the wiki; this swaps
      the groups when they are handed to esp_lcd. y is VERIFIED on hardware
      (TrailCurrent Capstan). If red and blue look swapped, flip this rather
      than editing the pin map.

comment "Touch"

config MATOUCH_TOUCH_MIRROR_X
    bool "Mirror touch horizontally"
    default n
    help
      Independent of the display transform. The touch layer is a separate
      device whose axes are fixed by how it is bonded, so work this out on
      the glass rather than copying the display's setting.

config MATOUCH_TOUCH_MIRROR_Y
    bool "Mirror touch vertically"
    default n

config MATOUCH_TOUCH_SWAP_XY
    bool "Swap touch X and Y axes"
    default n

comment "Rotary ring"

config MATOUCH_ENCODER_STEPS_PER_DETENT
    int "Quadrature counts per detent"
    range 1 8
    default 4
    help
      Counts the 4x quadrature decoder produces per mechanical detent. Too
      low and one felt click moves by two; too high and clicks are
      swallowed. Enable MATOUCH_ENCODER_DEBUG and turn one detent to measure.

config MATOUCH_ENCODER_INVERT
    bool "Invert rotation direction"
    default y
    help
      Clockwise must increase. VERIFIED on hardware: this board counts
      backwards without it.

config MATOUCH_ENCODER_DEBUG
    bool "Log raw encoder counts"
    default n

config MATOUCH_LONG_PRESS_MS
    int "Ring long-press duration (ms)"
    range 300 3000
    default 700

endmenu
